      "value": "I can't think of a single time where I've put an http URL into VRChat that wouldn't have been broken by silently modifying the URL to use https\n\nI guess I could see it not being a huge hassle if the port is not specified in the URL\n\nWhere are you finding non-https URLs to stick into VRChat?",
